#: rc.cpp:26
msgid ""
"AFMs (Adobe Font Metrics) are files that\n"
"may be used by programs (such as\n"
"StarOffice) to obtain detailed \"metrics\"\n"
"(e.g. sizes) of each character in a font -\n"
"so that it may be displayed/printed\n"
"correctly.\n"
"\n"
"AFMs may only contain one encoding,\n"
"so here you can specify which one\n"
"should be used."
msgstr ""
"AFM (Adobe Font Metrics) digäne ul\n"
"törle yazu bilgelären bastırğanda/kürsätkändä\n"
"tieşleçä çığaru öçen kiräk belem birüçe biremnär.\n"
"Bu biremnärne StarOffice kebek yazılımnar qullana.\n"
"\n"
"AFM eçendä ber genä bilgelämä bula ala,\n"
"anı üzenä dä üzgärtep bula."

#: rc.cpp:27
